  abilityDesc: 9 combo powerful Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), 6 combo massive Dark attack on single foe, casts stealth on self, boosting
    own Atk and critical hit rate for 2 turns, boosts critical damage of Dark types
    for 3 turns, hugely boosts Spark damage for 3 turns & hugely boosts own Spark
    damage for 3 turns
